# Quickload leg: reconstruct mid-level from a state with NO retained
# history — margins, shadow identity, and actor state must rebuild from
# scratch. The state is produced by route_jungle.dks (state_save).
state_load mid_level.state
0 * 120
checkpoint quickload_settled
pulse 1 12 45 base 82 088b >= 0280 timeout 6000
checkpoint quickload_advanced
0 * 60
